        },
        "subject": "LU-20373 ldiskfs: server support for v7.1",
        "message": "LU-20373 ldiskfs: server support for v7.1\n\nv7.0-rc1-12-g0b2600f81cefc\n  treewide: change inode->i_ino from unsigned long to u64\n\nv7.0-rc4-29-geb10607628acd\n  ext4: remove unused i_fc_wait\n\nv7.0-rc4-32-gaf1502f98e2cd\n  ext4: simplify mballoc preallocation size rounding for small files\n\nv7.0-rc4-40-g2879374604b72\n  ext4: split __ext4_add_entry() out of ext4_add_entry()\n\nv7.0-rc4-42-g52b4fea162dd3\n  ext4: move dcache manipulation out of __ext4_link()\n\nv7.0-rc6-4-g14a51045e10d3\n  get rid of busy-waiting in shrink_dcache_tree()\n\nUpdate patchs for:\n  ext4-dir-entry-len.patch\n  ext4-dirdata-core.patch\n  ext4-dirdata-lustre-compat.patch\n  ext4-give-warning-with-dir-htree-growing.patch\n  ext4-hash-indexed-dir-dotdot-update.patch\n  ext4-kill-dx-root.patch\n  ext4-lookup-dotdot.patch\n  ext4-mballoc-pa-free-mismatch.patch\n  ext4-pdirop.patch\n  ext4-prealloc.patch\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Shaun Tancheff <shaun.tancheff@hpe.com>\nChange-Id: I71a11663ddb647b9a12b3c57324f0379cabda07e\n"
      },
